<title>SLOVAKIA: Slovak c.bank reserves rises to $3.57 bln - Oct 23.</title>
<headline>Slovak c.bank reserves rises to $3.57 bln - Oct 23.</headline>
<dateline>BRATISLAVA 1996-10-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>The National Bank of Slovakia (NBS) on Friday said its hard currency reserves rose to $3.565 billion as of October 23 from $3.551 billion on October 16.</p>
<p> HARD CURRENCY RESERVES     Oct 23    Oct 16    Oct '95</p>
<p>  NBS reserves ($bln)	 3.565     3.551     2.873</p>
<p>  Commercial banks	    1.158     1.227     1.556</p>
<p>  Entire banking sector     4.723     4.778     4.429</p>
<p>-- Bratislava Newsroom, 42-7-563-3687</p>
</text>
